      <p class="fine">
        Terms, rates and the early fee are read live from the server, so this page shows what the app applies today. Locking can be switched off; when it is, the Lock tab is hidden and existing locks still unlock normally. Amounts are in US dollars. Locked $RECEIPT is staked for the term and is not sold or lent. Rewards are tokenized stock: debt securities giving economic exposure to the share price, not ownership. Nothing here is investment advice.
